 (channel . art)
 (body . "HASH CONSTELLATION

Content-addressed blocks as stars in the universe.
Created using: deterministic pseudo-random positioning, varying star brightness

    ·         •              ○        ·           ●
         ∙              ·         •        ○
  ○           ·    ●              ∙           ·
        •         ○         ·           •
   ·        ●          ∙         ○            ·
              ·    •        ●         ∙
      ○            ·           •         ○
  ●       ∙            ○    ·       •
         ·    •    ●         ∙           ○
    •         ○         ·        ●           ·
         ∙           ·    •         ○
  ·              ●        ○    ∙         •
       ○    ·         ∙         •           ●
           •    ○         ·         ∙
    ●         ·         •    ○           ·

Each star: a block in the store.
Each brightness: the depth of its reference graph.
Each position: determined by its hash.
The constellation: the visible structure of the fold.
The darkness between: the infinite space of possible hashes."))
